{"sections":[{"slug":"积闭范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"积闭范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">积闭范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"积闭范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">积闭范畴</span> (Cartesian closed category) <span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有有限</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意对象</span> $X\\in\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $X\\times (-)\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">有右伴随</span> $(-)^X\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">也即有如下自然同构</span>.$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X\\times Y,Z)\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,Z^X).\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}